{"t": 1792923210.947, "kind": "sent", "supplier_id": "sup:70270", "message": {"subject": "Re: Adapter piece HI: a price increase", "body": "Dear Sir or Madam,\n\nYou reminded us that when your firm held the old price for a quarter in a hard year, you expected partnership in return. We have not forgotten it, and this reply is meant as that partnership in practice: a solution that is fair for both family companies.\n\nOption A is the package we can approve. It gives you a clear price and a shorter payment term, and the claims below are the reasons we think it is right for both sides.\n\nOn quality:\nYour quality was 1531 ppm defective parts in the four quarters to 2026Q3 (sc:70270@2026Q3).\n\nOn your shop floor:\nObrábění Kraslin s.r.o. puts its turning shop on short-time work (news:20261020-S16).\n\nOn the cost side:\nGerman producer prices for cold-drawn bars changed -2.1% from 2026-05 to 2026-08 (idx:PPI-C2431@2026-05, idx:PPI-C2431@2026-08).\n\nWe can offer you the following options:\nOption A: unit price EUR 15.91; payment 45 days net.\nOption B: unit price EUR 16.00; payment 60 days net.\n\nIf you confirm Option A as it stands, we can confirm the order straight away.\n\nCould you please take Option A to the owner as it stands? It gives the company a settled price and payment on a predictable schedule, from a customer that values what the owner has done for us over the years.\n\nJust before closing, one sincere question: what would you need from us to confirm Option A?\n\nBest regards\nPurchasing\nHollerau Pumpenwerke GmbH", "term_sheets": [{"terms": {"unit_price": 15.91, "payment_days": 45}}, {"terms": {"unit_price": 16.0, "payment_days": 60}}], "refs": ["sc:70270@2026Q3", "news:20261020-S16", "idx:PPI-C2431@2026-05", "idx:PPI-C2431@2026-08"]}, "decide_s": 4.65}
